{"id": "tea:liberation-in-the-palm:four-point-analysis", "source": "src:liberation-in-the-palm", "location": {"ref": "four-point-analysis"}, "paraphrase": "Meditation on selflessness by four essential points: identifying the object of negation (the self as it appears to the innate self-grasping); ascertaining that if such a self existed it would have to be either one with the aggregates or different from them; ascertaining that it is not one; and ascertaining that it is not different.", "tags": {"level": "ultimate", "standpoint": "analytic", "naya": null, "path": ["meditation", "knowledge"], "stage": "advanced"}, "types": ["practice", "ultimate"], "teachers": ["tch:pabongkha"], "concepts": ["cpt:four-point-analysis"], "practices": ["prc:analytical-meditation-on-emptiness"], "notes": "Section-level ref; recent (1921) teaching.", "recent": true, "fidelity": {"status": "unchecked"}, "extraction": {"method": "skeleton", "extractors": ["U47-sakya-kadam-gelug"], "disagreements": []}, "verification": {"level": "skeleton", "confidence": "moderate", "unverified": false, "checks": []}, "provenance": {"units": ["skeleton:U47-sakya-kadam-gelug"], "phases": ["skeleton"]}}
